6\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold bg-gradient-to-r from-primary via-secondary to-accent bg-clip-text text-transparent leading-tight\">Find, compare &amp; decide.</h1><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-base-content/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">The smartest way to research phones, laptops, monitors, cars &amp; more</p><form class=\"w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search phones, laptops, cars...\" class=\"input input-bordered flex-1 text-base h-14\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary h-14 px-8 text-base\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z\"></path></svg>Search</button></div></form></div></section><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-16 pb-16\"><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><div class=\"cat-strip-outer\"><div class=\"cat-strip\">Loading categories…</div></div><!--/$--><section><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">📰 Latest News &amp; Guides</h2><a class=\"text-sm text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"/news\">More →</a></div><a href=\"https://www.xda-developers.com/astros-a-distro-that-combines-the-best-of-arch-cosmic-and-immutability-enters-beta/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"block mb-6 card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 duration-200 md:flex md:items-stretch md:overflow-hidden\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video md:aspect-auto md:w-80 md:shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://static0.xdaimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/astros-logo.jpg\" alt=\"AstrOS, a distro that combines the best of Arch, COSMIC, and immutability, enters beta\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">electronics</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-5 gap-2 flex-1\"><span class=\"badge badge-outline badge-sm self-start\">Featured</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold leading-tight\">AstrOS, a distro that combines the best of Arch, COSMIC, and immutability, enters beta</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">You&#x27;ll need a TPM 2.0 CPU for this one</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mt-auto text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">XDA Developers</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-01\">Aug 1, 2026</time></div></div></a><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><a href=\"https://www.techradar.com/pro/zelensky-confirms-ukraines-drones-will-reach-6-000-miles-in-2027-enough-to-cover-the-entirety-of-russia-and-able-to-reach-as-far-as-san-francisco-from-kyiv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/rpDiL2aBWBfnfUJ6QVXfnd-1280-80.png\" alt=\"Zelensky confirms Ukraine&#x27;s drones will reach 6,000 miles in 2027 — enough to cover the entirety of Russia and able to reach as far as San Francisco from Kyiv\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">cameras</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">Zelensky confirms Ukraine&#x27;s drones will reach 6,000 miles in 2027 — enough to cover the entirety of Russia and able to reach as far as San Francisco from Kyiv</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">Ukraine plans longer-range drones reaching 10,000 km by 2027 while pursuing US cooperation for production, testing, and advanced unmanned technology development.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">TechRadar</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-01\">5 hours ago</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://www.xda-developers.com/windows-has-been-quietly-wearing-out-your-ssd-and-the-fix-takes-one-setting/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://static0.xdaimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/wm/2026/07/crucial-ssd-desktop.jpg\" alt=\"Windows has been quietly wearing out your SSD, and the fix takes one setting\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">auto</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">Windows has been quietly wearing out your SSD, and the fix takes one setting</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">Microsoft wouldn&#x27;t take care of my storage, so I will</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">XDA Developers</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-01\">5 hours ago</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/07/31/gemini-ai-studio-app/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/8804/600/340\" alt=\"Gemini will create mobile &amp; desktop apps in the future as AI Studio for Android, iOS is canceled\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">mobiles</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">Gemini will create mobile &amp; desktop apps in the future as AI Studio for Android, iOS is canceled</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">At I/O 2026, Google teased an AI Studio app for Android and iOS. This mobile application has been canceled in favor of what sounds like a deep Gemini app integration.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">9to5Google</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://www.xda-developers.com/amd-promised-am5-support-until-2029-and-the-memory-crisis-might-not-let-it-stop-there/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg-base-200 border border-base-300 hover:border-primary transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-200\"><figure class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-base-300\"><img src=\"https://static0.xdaimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/wm/2024/11/amd-ryzen-7-9800x3d-installed.jpg\" alt=\"AMD promised AM5 support until 2029, and the memory crisis might not let it stop there\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 badge badge-md badge-primary\">tech</span></figure><div class=\"card-body p-4 gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold line-clamp-2 leading-snug\">AMD promised AM5 support until 2029, and the memory crisis might not let it stop there</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-base-content/60 line-clamp-3\">AM5 is now the past, present, and apparently, the future for consumer PCs</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-sm text-base-content/50\"><span class=\"font-medium\">XDA Developers</span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-31\">Yesterday</time></div></div></a><a href=\"https://www.techradar.com/pro/grab-1-54tb-free-cloud-storage-for-life-but-you-will-need-to-sign-up-43-services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"card bg